# M-SOV09 -- W2-CA-15 mind control + W2-CA-02 PlayerControl + W2-CA-05.
# SOV09u: the player (Confederation, side from RA2 rules.ini) orders the two
# Yuris of the PlayerControl house Africans onto the President; Yuri's
# MindControl weapon takes him over -> 'Pres is Captured' (event 44 by
# Africans, the TeamType Tag on the President) -> WON. Cheats: the Allied /
# Russian patrols and base defences are removed (combat skip); the attack
# order is the player's real World order.
set render_every 600
set on_quit continue
set campaign sov09u.MAP Nod

until 60 scene == campaign-load
require scene == campaign-load
click start
until 300 scene == game
require scene == game
assert mode == campaign
until 3000 units(6,YURI) >= 2 and carried(6) == 0   # W4-SQ-06: the Yuris arrive by paradrop
wait 120
cheat camp_killu 1 *
cheat camp_killu 2 *
cheat camp_killu 4 *
cheat camp_killu 5 *
cheat camp_killu 8 *
cheat camp_killu 9 *
cheat camp_killdef
cheat camp_attacku YURI 3 PRES
until 3000 outcome == WON
assert outcome == WON
